---
description: Bookly three-plane architecture and money-safety rules
globs: app/**/*.py, tests/**/*.py
alwaysApply: true
---
Follow AGENTS.md. When adding a tool: register it in app/tools/definitions.py
with required_slots, add the decision function to app/policy/engine.py, add the
system call to app/backend/bookly_api.py, extend MockProvider in
app/llm/providers.py, and add scenario tests. Keep README counts accurate.
